flowchart TD
    A[Event Triggered: Health Log or Med Log Update] --> B{Event Type?}

    B -- Health --> C[Health Alert Path]
    B -- Medication --> D[Medication Alert Path]

    C --> E{Risk Level High?}
    D --> F{Check Adherence}

    E -- Yes --> G[Send Notification: Push or Email]
    E -- Low --> H[Notification Sent]

    F -- Missed or Late --> G
    F -- Taken --> H

    G --> H
